      ],
      "title": "未尽终局·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42541001",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "潮酷街区，管理局。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "资料都提交过去了，确定没有遗漏。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯，检查今天的日程。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>今日事务处理完毕，仅剩最后一件非紧急事件，请确认。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "「工作结束后拜访导师」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>观察到您多次查看这条待办事项，建议您提升这项工作的优先级。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……不必。\n导师她肯定很忙，我们回「边界咖啡馆」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "嗯？前面这间实验室，怎么之前没有见过？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "帕拉斯，检索相关信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>抱歉，未能找到这间实验室的任何信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "没有门禁，我们进去看看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "看得出来是一间芯片研究实验室。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "只是，为什么从未听「管理局」提起过？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>「唯有勇敢的人，才能在纷繁的表象之后获取真知。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "关掉这个语音提示，我没有想要提问的意思。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "好奇心是保持活力的秘诀，任何时候都不应将其舍弃。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我说了，关掉语音提示系统。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯特莱雅",
          "text": "是我在这里哦，希塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "导师……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯特莱雅",
          "text": "呵，真是好久不见，需要一个温暖的拥抱吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "不了，您在这里做什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯特莱雅",
          "text": "这问题真奇怪，这里可是管理局的机密场所，应该是我问你在这里做什么。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "我只是有点迷路。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯特莱雅",
          "text": "嗯，M城大名鼎鼎的「浮游炮小姐」，原来也有不熟悉的地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "……我还有些工作要处理，先走了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "阿斯特莱雅",
          "text": "不如就让我牵着你的手，把你带到正确的出口吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "谢谢，「帕拉斯」会带我出去的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "分析仪和光刻机……那个实验室里居然都是些研发芯片的设备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "希塔",
          "text": "导师出现在那里，只是一个巧合吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>终端已接收到一条新的消息，发信人【阿斯特莱雅】。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42541031",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "帕拉斯",
          "text": ">>>「亲爱的希塔，我们还会再见的。」",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1089",
